# 基础词 Unit11
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit11核心词汇

{{coat}}{/kəʊt/}{{n. 外套；涂层}}{{She wore a warm coat in the cold weather.}}
{{code}}{/kəʊd/}{{n. 代码；密码；法规}}{{The software developer writes code all day long.}}
{{coffee}}{/ˈkɒfi/}}n. 咖啡}}{{I drink a cup of coffee every morning.}}
{{coin}}{/kɔɪn/}}n. 硬币；v. 创造（新词）}}{{The scientist coined a new term for the discovery.}}
{{cold}}{/kəʊld/}}adj. 冷的；n. 感冒}}{{It was extremely cold during the winter storm.}}
{{collapse}}{/kəˈlæps/}}v./n. 倒塌；崩溃}}{{The old building collapsed during the earthquake.}}
{{colleague}}{/ˈkɒliːɡ/}}n. 同事}}{{She gets along well with all her colleagues.}}
{{collect}}{/kəˈlekt/}}v. 收集；领取}}{{He collects stamps as a hobby.}}
{{college}}{/ˈkɒlɪdʒ/}}n. 大学；学院}}{{She graduated from a prestigious college last year.}}
{{colony}}{/ˈkɒləni/}}n. 殖民地；群落}}{{The island was once a British colony.}}
{{color}}{/ˈkʌlər/}}n. 颜色；v. 给…着色}}{{What is your favorite color?}}
{{column}}{/ˈkɒləm/}}n. 柱；栏；专栏}}{{She writes a weekly column for the newspaper.}}
{{combine}}{/kəmˈbaɪn/}}v. 结合；联合}}{{We need to combine our efforts to finish on time.}}
{{come}}{/kʌm/}}v. 来；来到}}{{Come and sit next to me.}}
{{comfort}}{/ˈkʌmfərt/}}n. 舒适；安慰；v. 安慰}}{{The hotel room provided great comfort during our stay.}}
{{command}}{/kəˈmɑːnd/}}v./n. 命令；指挥}}{{The general commanded his troops to advance.}}
{{comment}}{/ˈkɒment/}}n. 评论；v. 评论}}{{She made a helpful comment about the presentation.}}
{{commercial}}{/kəˈmɜːrʃl/}}adj. 商业的；n. 广告}}{{The commercial success of the product surprised everyone.}}
{{commission}}{/kəˈmɪʃn/}}n. 委员会；佣金；v. 委托}}{{He earns a commission on every sale he makes.}}
{{commit}}{/kəˈmɪt/}}v. 犯（罪）；承诺；投入}}{{She committed herself to finishing the project on time.}}
{{committee}}{/kəˈmɪti/}}n. 委员会}}{{The committee meets every Monday to discuss business.}}
{{common}}{/ˈkɒmən/}}adj. 常见的；共同的}}{{Colds are very common during the winter months.}}
{{communicate}}{/kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt/}}v. 交流；传达}}{{It is important to communicate clearly with your team.}}
{{community}}{/kəˈmjuːnəti/}}n. 社区；群体}}{{The local community organized a charity event.}}
{{company}}{/ˈkʌmpəni/}}n. 公司；陪伴}}{{She works for a large technology company.}}
{{compare}}{/kəmˈpeər/}}v. 比较；对比}}{{Compare the prices before making a purchase.}}
{{compete}}{/kəmˈpiːt/}}v. 竞争；比赛}}{{Several companies compete for the same market.}}
{{complain}}{/kəmˈpleɪn/}}v. 抱怨；投诉}}{{He always complains about the food at the cafeteria.}}
{{complete}}{/kəmˈpliːt/}}adj. 完全的；v. 完成}}{{The project was completed ahead of schedule.}}
{{complex}}{/ˈkɒmpleks/}}adj. 复杂的；n. 综合体}}{{The problem is more complex than we initially thought.}}
{{component}}{/kəmˈpəʊnənt/}}n. 成分；组件}}{{Each component of the machine must be inspected carefully.}}
{{compose}}{/kəmˈpəʊz/}}v. 组成；创作；使镇静}}{{The committee is composed of ten members.}}
{{computer}}{/kəmˈpjuːtər/}}n. 计算机；电脑}}{{Computers have revolutionized the way we work.}}
{{concentrate}}{/ˈkɒnsntreɪt/}}v. 集中；专注}}{{I need to concentrate on my studies right now.}}
{{concept}}{/ˈkɒnsept/}}n. 概念；观念}}{{The concept of democracy is fundamental to modern society.}}
{{concern}}{/kənˈsɜːrn/}}n. 关心；忧虑；v. 关心；涉及}}{{Environmental pollution is a major concern for everyone.}}
{{conclude}}{/kənˈkluːd/}}v. 结束；得出结论}}{{The study concluded that exercise improves mental health.}}
{{condition}}{/kənˈdɪʃn/}}n. 条件；状况}}{{The roads are in poor condition after the storm.}}
{{conduct}}{/kənˈdʌkt/}}v. 进行；指挥；n. 行为}}{{The scientist conducted an experiment in the laboratory.}}
{{conference}}{/ˈkɒnfərəns/}}n. 会议；研讨会}}{{The international conference attracted experts from 50 countries.}}
